## 4. Run the backend commands by hand first

Before any UI work, make sure the commands behind the menu work from a terminal. The extension runs exactly these:

```bash
ws-base status
ws-base check latest
ws-publish share          # pushes a tag ws/<you>/<time> to GitLab
ws-publish promote        # pushes a branch ws/<you>/<time>
```

If `ws-publish share` fails here, fix that first (remote, token, base commit present in GitLab). The menu will show the same error.

