## 11. Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `dev-setup.sh`: "JupyterLab not found in …" | module still installing, or it used `uv` | wait for `/tmp/jupyterlab.log`; make sure `pipx` is in the image |
| `pipx environment: error: unrecognized arguments: --value` | old pipx | use `pipx environment` and read `PIPX_LOCAL_VENVS`, or `VENV=~/.local/share/pipx/venvs/jupyterlab` (older pipx: `~/.local/pipx/venvs/jupyterlab`) |
| `pip install -e` / `jlpm install` hang or fail | no access to PyPI / npm | `PIP_INDEX_URL`, `YARN_NPM_REGISTRY_SERVER` to your mirrors |
| No button after `dev-setup.sh` | browser tab not reloaded, or build failed | reload; `jupyter labextension list` must show `ws-actions … enabled OK` |
| Button there, every action "404 Not Found" | server half not loaded | `grep ws_actions /tmp/jupyterlab.log`; rerun `restart-jupyter.sh` |
| "ws-publish: command not found" | not on JupyterLab's `PATH` | set `WS_PUBLISH_BIN=/opt/ws/ws-publish` (and `WS_BASE_BIN`) in the pod env, or fix `PATH` |
| Share: "read base sha: … /scratch/.base_commit_sha" | `SCRATCH_ROOT` wrong | `SCRATCH_ROOT=/data/overlay` in the pod env |
| Share: "upperdir empty — nothing to publish" | no changes in the overlay | edit a file in `~/workspace` first |
| Update: "controller not running (/tmp/ws-base/req missing)" | `ws-base serve` not started by the entrypoint | use the `ws-base` entrypoint from the overlay guide (section 4b) |
| After Update, an open notebook still shows old content | open handles keep the old mount | reload the file, restart the kernel (the menu reminds the user) |
| Share output shows `https://***@…` | a git error from `ws-publish` | expected: the token is redacted; read the rest of the message |
| `.ipynb_checkpoints` in a shared commit | JupyterLab ran without the checkpoint setting | module `config` from step 2 (`FileCheckpoints.root_dir`); delete the folder from `~/workspace` |
| All actions "(dry run) …" | JupyterLab still has `WS_ACTIONS_DRY_RUN=1` | `restart-jupyter.sh` from a terminal without that variable |

